@startuml

autoactivate on

title 공개설정

actor 관리자 as admin

box "메타 데이터 공개 설정"
participant Client as client
participant MetaDataManageController as metaDataManageController
participant MetaDataManageService as metaDataManageService
end box

box "Elasticsearch 작업수행 서버"
participant FastApi as fastApi
end box

client -> metaDataManageController : 메타데이터 공개설정 요청
metaDataManageController -> metaDataManageService : 메타데이터 공개설정 요청
metaDataManageService -> fastApi : Elasticsearch 동기화 요청
fastApi -> metaDataManageService : Elasticsearch 동기화 완료
metaDataManageService -> metaDataManageController : 메타데이터 공개설정 결과 반환
metaDataManageController -> client : 메타데이터 공개설정 결과 반환

@enduml